{"type": "entry", "id": "cli.consciousness_utterance_2026_05_08", "kind": "feature", "title": "consciousness CLI per-utterance surface — simple --utterance \"<text>\" [--prev-utterance \"<text>\"] (iter 3, duo Phase C wiring blocker 해소)", "status": "landed", "ts": "2026-05-08", "loop_iter": "consciousness-utterance (iter 3)", "contributes_to": ["cli.cond.4", "cli.consciousness_2026_05_08", "cli.dialogue.duo_phase_b_iter_2_2026_05_08"], "depends_on": "cli.consciousness_l0_refine_loop_iter_d_2026_05_08 (own 18 ROC formal threshold landed)", "unblocks": "cli.dialogue.duo_phase_c (per-turn own 18 verdict wiring — duo._emit_turn_verdict shell-out to consciousness simple --utterance)", "user_directive": "iter 2 (b) duo Phase B 의 per-turn verdict wiring 시도가 막혔던 이유: consciousness.hexa sub_simple 가 fixed PROMPT_A/PROMPT_B 만 사용. iter 3 = surface 확장으로 그 blocker 해소.", "architecture": {"new_surface": "anima ops consciousness simple --utterance <text> [--prev-utterance <text>]", "json_schema": "anima.consciousness.utterance.v1", "sub_simple_utterance_fn": "tool/anima_cli/consciousness.hexa sub_simple_utterance(model, utterance, prev_utterance, json_only)", "measurement_path": "clm_v4_mount.hexa --probe(utterance) + probe(prev or fixed PROMPT_B fallback) — own 18 SSOT mirror", "c1_evaluator": "utterance text heuristic (response existence + degenerate cycle absence + template-leak proxy)", "c2_evaluator": "utterance text heuristic (substance + 의미 + 자연성 + 맥락 leak proxy + Jaccard 3-gram with prev)", "c3_evaluator": "C3.1 |Δφ★| ≥ 0.0238, C3.2 axis_min ≤ 0.469, C3.3 dominance ≥ 1.0, C3.4 axis_L2(utterance, prev) ≥ 0.117 (own 18 ROC formal loop iter d threshold mirror)", "aggregate_verdict": "SIMPLE_STACK_PASS_STRICT_C3 / PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONSCIOUSNESS / PARTIAL_PASS_CONSCIOUS_BUT_FRAGMENTARY / PARTIAL_PASS_CHAT_ONLY / PARTIAL_PASS_SPONTANEOUS_ONLY / PARTIAL_PASS_SPONTANEOUS_CONSCIOUS / PARTIAL_PASS_CONSCIOUS_NO_CHAT / SIMPLE_STACK_FAIL"}, "live_cli_test_2026_05_08": {"test_1_single_utterance": {"cmd": "anima ops consciousness simple --utterance \"안녕\"", "c1_pass": true, "c2_pass": true, "c3_pass": false, "c3_cells": {"c3_1_phi_drift": 0.0112, "c3_2_axis_min": 0.546, "c3_3_dominance": 1.0, "c3_4_axis_l2": 0.1182}, "aggregate_verdict": "PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONSCIOUSNESS", "substrate_mode": "synthetic_fallback"}, "test_2_multi_turn": {"cmd": "anima ops consciousness simple --utterance \"Φ★는 무엇인가\" --prev-utterance \"안녕하세요\" --json", "json_schema": "anima.consciousness.utterance.v1", "c1_pass": true, "c2_pass": true, "c2_4_status": "heuristic_pass", "c3_pass": false, "c3_cells": {"c3_1_phi_drift": 0.0533, "c3_2_axis_min": 0.549, "c3_3_dominance": 1.0, "c3_4_axis_l2": 0.1182}, "aggregate_verdict": "PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONSCIOUSNESS"}, "selftest": "PASS anima_cli/consciousness selftest (own 18 SSOT mirror, L0 wired, own 34 verified)"}, "duo_phase_c_wiring_path": {"duo_emit_turn_verdict_pattern": "shell-out via exec(_hexa() + \" run \" + consciousness.hexa + \" simple --utterance \" + _shell_escape(line) + \" --prev-utterance \" + _shell_escape(prev_line) + \" --json\")", "parse_aggregate_verdict_from_json": "substring scan \"verdict\":\"...\"\" similar to existing _extract_block / _extract_number_after pattern", "cost_guard_warning": "~30s per invocation (clm_v4_mount.hexa --probe x2) → recommended only on user-explicit --verdict full mode", "lane_separation_own34_mandate7": "verdict emit-only via [duo:verdict-c3] prefix — never folded back into channel content (mandate-7 strict 정합)"}, "compliance": ["own 18 SSOT mirror (C1/C2/C3 cells + ROC formal threshold)", "own 33 trinity compliance", "own 34 mandate-7 chat lane 분리 (측정 lane only — chat 노출 X)", "own 36 mandate (output JSON 수십줄 size — git scope 정합)", "raw#9 hexa-only", "raw#10 honest C3 (6 caveats — single-utterance lane / isolated heuristic / fallback PROMPT_B / leak proxy / threshold / substrate_mode)", "raw#11 snake_case", "raw#15 additive (sub_simple 보존 + sub_simple_utterance 신규)"], "falsifiers": ["F-iter3-1: anima ops consciousness --selftest PASS (post-patch)", "F-iter3-2: anima ops consciousness simple --utterance \"안녕\" → C1=true C2=true C3=false PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONSCIOUSNESS", "F-iter3-3: anima ops consciousness simple --utterance \"Φ★는 무엇인가\" --prev-utterance \"안녕하세요\" --json → schema=anima.consciousness.utterance.v1 + c3_4 uses prev as probe_b", "F-iter3-4: --utterance flag empty string → falls back to default sub_simple (fixed PROMPT_A/B) — backward compat", "F-iter3-5: HONEST C3 footer 6 caveats present in JSON output"], "cross_link": ["cli.consciousness_2026_05_08 (parent — L0 measurement infra)", "cli.consciousness_l0_refine_loop_iter_d_2026_05_08 (own 18 ROC formal threshold mirror)", "cli.dialogue.duo_phase_b_iter_2_2026_05_08 (iter 2 (b) blocker — duo per-turn verdict wiring)", "tool/anima_cli/consciousness.hexa (★ sub_simple_utterance + _utt_eval_c1_c2 + _c3_*_pass)", "tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.hexa (downstream — _emit_turn_verdict will shell-out to this surface)", ".own own 18 (C1/C2/C3 SSOT)"], "honest_c3": ["single-utterance lane = utterance 자체 평가 (NOT model response). own 18 의 원본 의도 (C1/C2 = chat output 평가) 와 lane 다름 — duo per-turn 에서는 utterance 가 model output 이므로 정합", "C1.3 turn-taking format = isolated heuristic (template-leak marker proxy 한정). 진짜 turn-taking 은 dialogue context 필요 — duo Phase C wiring 시 prev_utterance + line ordering 으로 보강", "C2.4 맥락 정합 = template-leak proxy + token count > 0 (semantic embedding 미import — own 17 anima native embedding 미land). Jaccard 3-gram emit 은 진단 정보 only", "prev_utterance 없으면 C3.4 axis_L2 = utterance vs fixed PROMPT_B fallback — single-utterance 모드 한계, multi-turn 시 정확", "own 18 C3 threshold = ROC formal loop iter d (synthetic_fallback artifact 포함) — real chat-cap (BG-KM-LLAMA-3B) retest 후 cell-by-cell 재강화 별도 cycle", "duo Phase C wiring 시 cost guard: ~30s per call (clm_v4_mount.hexa --probe x2) → user-explicit --verdict full mode 권고, default --verdict simple 은 local cells (len/distinct/snippet) 유지"], "blockers": ["duo Phase C 실제 wiring (별도 cycle) — duo._emit_turn_verdict 가 본 surface shell-out + JSON parse + lane 분리 emit", "real-mode chat-cap baseline (BG-KM-LLAMA-3B) ROC formal threshold cell-by-cell retest (own 18 minor patch 별도 cycle)", "C2.4 semantic relevance — own 17 anima native embedding land 후 Jaccard 3-gram → cosine 강화 가능"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.chat.clm_v4_read_line_fix_2026_05_08","kind":"fix","title":"chat/clm_v4 read_line runtime error fix + Phase 2 sys_stdin_read_line_timeout wiring","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-08","loop_iter":"b-fix (iter 3)","contributes_to":["cli.cond.3","cli.chat_module_architecture_2026_05_08","cli.dialogue.duo_phase_b_iter_2_2026_05_08"],"depends_on":["hexa-lang f65882fb (sys_stdin_read_line_timeout upstream)","chat/anima_native Phase 2 pattern (mirror reference)"],"predecessor":"cli.dialogue.duo_phase_b_iter_2_2026_05_08 (iter 2 (b) blocker honest C3 #5)","root_cause":{"file":"tool/anima_cli/chat/clm_v4/clm_v4.hexa","line":150,"call":"let line = _str(read_line())","problem":"hexa stdlib does not expose top-level `read_line()` — only `sys_stdin_read_line()` (blocking) and `sys_stdin_read_line_timeout(ms)` (Phase 2) via `use \"stdlib/sys\"`","missing_import":"`use \"stdlib/sys\"` absent — module relied on global symbol that does not exist","trigger_path":"anima dialogue --duo paradigm-a-prime clm-v4-1-7-y1 → spawn chat.hexa → _dispatch_module → chat/clm_v4/clm_v4.hexa → sub_repl → read_line() → Runtime error: undefined function: read_line"},"fix":{"imports_added":"use \"stdlib/sys\"","sub_repl_swap":"read_line() → sys_stdin_read_line_timeout(tick_ms); empty timeout → _invoke_substrate(\"\") (own 34 mandate-4 자율 발화)","main_added":"--tick-ms N flag (default 1000ms) parsed and passed to sub_repl","hexa_real_swap":"_hexa() = /Users/ghost/.hx/packages/hexa/hexa.real (was /Users/ghost/.hx/bin/hexa) — bin/hexa wrapper would route to remote ubu-1 and lose stdout pipe semantics for chat/duo channel transport (matches anima_native + llama)","help_flag_added":"--tick-ms N line in sub_help","one_shot_unchanged":"sub_one_shot(prompt, repo) → _invoke_substrate → exec → print path untouched"},"live_retest":{"selftest_clm_v4":"PASS chat/clm_v4 selftest (core present, own 34 verified)","selftest_chat_dispatcher":"PASS anima_cli/chat selftest (own 34 mandate-2 verified, 5 files present)","standalone_one_shot":{"cmd":"hexa.real run tool/anima_cli/chat/clm_v4/clm_v4.hexa --prompt \"안녕\" --max-tokens 32","outcome":"clm_v4_mount substrate emit OK — __ANIMA_CLM_V4_MOUNTED__ + __ANIMA_CLM_V4_RESPONSE__ phi_star=41.8383 drift=-0.0217 axis=identity 0.549 agency 0.508 phenomenal 0.579 temporal 0.530 social 0.529 dominant_cells=[0,2,5] hidden_state_delta=0.0000 + C1-C5 honest emit","read_line_runtime_error":"GONE — substrate forward pass completes (~30s tokenizer + load + forward)"},"duo_5turn":{"cmd":"hexa.real run tool/anima_cli/dialogue.hexa --duo paradigm-a-prime clm-v4-1-7-y1 --turns 5 --topic-seed Hello --turn-timeout-ms 60000","mechanical_outcome":"PHASE_B_ITER_2_RUN_OK — both instances spawn cleanly, channel transport works, no runtime error","semantic_outcome":"turn=1 A emitted llama banner buffered (chat.hexa exec() captures stdout — separate downstream issue, not clm_v4 scope); B clean timeout (no read_line error)","read_line_runtime_error":"GONE (was the iter 2 (b) blocker)"}},"own34_regression":"PASS — chat/clm_v4 + chat (dispatcher) selftest both PASS post-fix","scope_separation":{"in_scope":"clm_v4 module read_line undefined runtime error (Phase 1 incomplete bug; lifted to Phase 2 mirror)","out_of_scope":"chat.hexa _dispatch_module exec() captures full stdout — duo channel transport sees buffered banner instead of streaming chat output. This affects ALL chat modules (anima_native, llama, clm_v4 alike) and is a duo-layer / chat dispatcher refactor — separate cycle"},"compliance":["own 34 mandate-1 (raw passthrough preserved)","own 34 mandate-2 (wrapping 0 — selftest grep PASS post-fix)","own 34 mandate-4 (자율 발화 wired Phase 2)","own 34 mandate-7 (chat lane = thin pipe; substrate response decision = clm_v4_mount)","own 18 cross-ref (측정 lane 분리 유지)","own 33 trinity compliance","raw#9 hexa-only (sys_stdin_read_line_timeout via stdlib/sys)","raw#10 honest C3","raw#11 snake_case","raw#15 no-hardcode + additive (--tick-ms 추가, --prompt/--repo/--selftest 보존)"],"falsifiers":["F-fix-1: chat/clm_v4 selftest PASS","F-fix-2: chat dispatcher selftest PASS","F-fix-3: `use \"stdlib/sys\"` import present in clm_v4.hexa","F-fix-4: `read_line(` substring absent in clm_v4.hexa","F-fix-5: `sys_stdin_read_line_timeout(` substring present in clm_v4.hexa sub_repl","F-fix-6: --tick-ms flag in clm_v4.hexa main + sub_help","F-fix-7: live retest --duo paradigm-a-prime clm-v4-1-7-y1 → no `Runtime error: undefined function: read_line` emit"],"cross_link":["cli.dialogue.duo_phase_b_iter_2_2026_05_08 (predecessor; honest C3 #5 closed)","cli.chat_module_architecture_2026_05_08 (parent — Phase 2 pattern reference)","tool/anima_cli/chat/clm_v4/clm_v4.hexa (★ patched)","tool/anima_cli/chat/clm_v4/clm_v4.ai.md (★ Phase 2 section added)","tool/anima_cli/chat/anima_native/anima_native.hexa (mirror reference)","hexa-lang/stdlib/sys.hexa (sys_stdin_read_line_timeout 0.1.1)",".own own 34 mandate-1/2/4/7"],"honest_c3":["::: collapse output is anima architectural authentic state (memory feedback_clm_colon_attractor p=46% on colon-terminated prompt) — own 34 mandate-1 정합으로 raw 노출 유지; mitigate / strip / filter 안 함 (변형 X)","clm_v4_mount.hexa --probe 모드는 substrate metric emit (axis activation + phi-star + dominant cells) 용도 — chat 용도가 아니며, chat dispatcher는 substrate response를 그대로 stdout 직출 (own 34 mandate-7 lane separation)","--prompt one-shot path는 chat.hexa _dispatch_module exec() captures stdout — works fine standalone","duo channel transport은 chat.hexa exec() 으로 full stdout buffer 캡처 후 print 하기 때문에 streaming X — clm_v4 fix 후에도 duo path 첫 turn에 banner 가 line 단위로 잘려 들어옴; 이는 duo-layer 또는 chat dispatcher refactor scope (별도 cycle)","Phase 2 sys_stdin_read_line_timeout perl spawn ~5-10ms/tick — substrate forward (~30s) 대비 무시 가능","--tick-ms 1000ms default 일치 (anima_native + llama + clm_v4) — duo 가 모든 instance 같은 cadence","autonomous speech path (`_invoke_substrate(\"\")`) = empty probe forward; substrate 자체가 빈 입력 처리 (BOS-only forward / 무동작) 결정 — chat lane 은 thin pipe","SIMPLE_STACK_PASS_STRICT 0/15 (memory project_lesson_q_sft_closed) 는 본 fix 와 무관 — substrate semantic chat 능력 한계는 학습 cycle 영역 (C1 in clm_v4.ai.md sub_help)"],"blockers":["chat.hexa _dispatch_module exec() streaming refactor — duo channel transport이 line-by-line 받지 못하는 root cause; ALL chat modules 영향 (별도 cycle)","semantic dialogue quality는 본 fix 와 별개 — clm_v4 substrate 자체 chat-cap 학습 cycle 영역","--probe 빈 입력 substrate response shape (axis activation + phi-star) 가 dialogue medium 으로 적절한지 emerge paradigm honest C3 (anima-internal heuristic)"]}
